#: adjustcurves.cpp:162
msgid "<p>Select here the curve type to draw for the current channel.<p><b>Smooth</b>: this mode constrains the curve type to a smooth line with tension.<p><b>Free</b>: with this mode, you can draw your curve free-hand with the mouse."
msgstr ""

#: adjustcurves.cpp:177
msgid "<p>This is the curve drawing of the selected image histogram channel"
msgstr ""

#: adjustcurves.cpp:195
msgid "All channels shadow tone color picker"
msgstr ""

#: adjustcurves.cpp:196
msgid "<p>With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set <b>Shadow Tone</b> smooth curves point on Red, Green, Blue, and Luminosity channels."
msgstr ""

#: adjustcurves.cpp:205
msgid "All channels middle tone color picker"
msgstr ""

#: adjustcurves.cpp:206
msgid "<p>With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set <b>Middle Tone</b> smooth curves point on Red, Green, Blue, and Luminosity channels."
msgstr ""

#: adjustcurves.cpp:215
msgid "All channels highlight tone color picker"
msgstr ""

#: adjustcurves.cpp:216
msgid "<p>With this button, you can pick the color from original image used to set <b>Highlight Tone</b> smooth curves point on Red, Green, Blue, and Luminosity channels."
msgstr ""

